text: ['({T}: Add {R}.)', 'Dragon spells you cast cost {1} less to cast.', 'Flying\\nWhenever Korvold, Fae-Cursed King enters the battlefield or attacks, sacrifice another permanent.\\nWhenever you sacrifice a permanent, put a +1/+1 counter on Korvold and draw a card.', 'Flying\\n{2}: Steel Hellkite gets +1/+0 until end of turn.\\n{X}: Destroy each nonland permanent with mana value X whose controller was dealt combat damage by Steel Hellkite this turn. Activate only once each turn.', 'Whenever a creature with flying enters the battlefield under your control, it gains haste until end of turn.\\nWhenever a Dragon enters the battlefield under your control, it deals X damage to any target, where X is the number of Dragons you control.', '[+1]: Draw a card, then add one mana of any color.\\n[−2]: Create a 4/4 red Dragon creature token with flying.\\n[−8]: Search your library for any number of Dragon creature cards, put them onto the battlefield, then shuffle.']
flavor: ['Becoming a dragon only sharpened his raw ambitions.', 'The tastiest morsels rarely make it to their intended destination.']
artist: ['Song Qijin', 'TSWCK', 'Walleystation']
